Translation:
【{bad_name}】,
if you want to challenge Master 【STEEL HEART】,
you'll have to beat us first!

【SWIFT EMPEROR】 and 【SNAKE EYES】 the top dogs of the Shuto Expressway;
You who took them both down; and 【ETERNAL POLARIS】...
You four are the elites of the next generation—THE 4 NOVAS.

They're not just skilled racers;
they're bound by business interests too, which makes them tight-knit.
That's their advantage over the rival 《Phantom9》.
